      "content": "The wash sale rule: sell a security at a loss + rebuy within 30 days = IRS disallows the deduction e\n\nThe wash sale rule: sell a security at a loss + rebuy within 30 days = IRS disallows the deduction entirely. Most investors trigger it accidentally by buying back immediately. Substantially identical rule catches fund-to-fund swaps. The loss adds to cost basis — timing benefit is destroyed. Crypto currently exempt. #moneyfacts #taxlossharvesting #washsalerule #investing #taxfacts",
