      "content": "Rent payments don't build your credit score by default — landlords have no obligation to report to b\n\nRent payments don't build your credit score by default — landlords have no obligation to report to bureaus. Mortgages, car loans, credit cards: reported automatically. Rent: invisible unless you opt into a reporting service. This affects millions of renters building zero credit history while paying perfectly. #moneyfacts #creditScore #rent #financialliteracy #personalfinance",
