      "content": "Most 401k employer matches have vesting schedules — cliff (0% until year 3, then 100%) or graded (20\n\nMost 401k employer matches have vesting schedules — cliff (0% until year 3, then 100%) or graded (20%/year). Leave before fully vested and you forfeit the unvested portion to the plan. Your own contributions are always 100% yours. Check your vesting schedule before resigning — it can be worth thousands. #moneyfacts #401k #vestingschedule #retirement #personalfinance",
